    {
      "source": "BeanInfoFactories are instantiated by the <a href=\"CachedIntrospectionResults.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans\"><code>CachedIntrospectionResults</code></a>,\nby using the <a href=\"../core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a>\nutility class.\n\nWhen a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/BeanInfo.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>BeanInfo</code></a> is to be created, the <code>CachedIntrospectionResults</code>\nwill iterate through the discovered factories, calling <a href=\"#getBeanInfo(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getBeanInfo(Class)</code></a>\non each one. If <code>null</code> is returned, the next factory will be queried.\nIf none of the factories support the class, a standard <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/BeanInfo.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>BeanInfo</code></a> will be\ncreated as a default.",
      "translation": "`BeanInfoFactories` 由 `<a href=\"CachedIntrospectionResults.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans\"><code>CachedIntrospectionResults</code></a>` 实例化，使用的是 `<a href=\"../core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a>` 工具类。\n\n当需要创建 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/BeanInfo.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>BeanInfo</code></a>` 时，`<code>CachedIntrospectionResults</code>` 将遍历发现的各个工厂，并调用其上的 `<a href=\"#getBeanInfo(java.lang.Class)\"><code>getBeanInfo(Class)</code></a>` 方法。如果返回 `<code>null</code>`，则查询下一个工厂。如果没有任何工厂支持该类，则将创建一个标准的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/BeanInfo.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>BeanInfo</code></a>` 作为默认值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the <a href=\"../core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a>\nsorts the <code>BeanInfoFactory</code> instances by\n<a href=\"../core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>@Order</code></a>, so that ones with a\nhigher precedence come first.",
      "translation": "注意，<a href=\"../core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> 会根据 <a href=\"../core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>@Order</code></a> 对 <code>BeanInfoFactory</code> 实例进行排序，使优先级较高的实例排在前面。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the bean info for the given class, if supported.",
      "translation": "如果支持，则返回给定类的 Bean 信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/IntrospectionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\">IntrospectionException</a></code> - in case of exceptions",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/IntrospectionException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\">IntrospectionException</a></code> - 在发生异常的情况下",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "the BeanInfo, or <code>null</code> if the given class is not supported",
      "translation": "BeanInfo，或者如果给定的类不受支持则为<code>null</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
